  "plan": "1) Check DNS resolution and basic connectivity. 2) Try a plain-HTTP request to the Solana RPC URL to see if a proxy expects HTTP. 3) Try another well-known HTTPS host to see if general internet works. 4) Test if there is a transparent proxy by attempting a raw HTTP GET. This will tell me how to make outbound calls.",
  "commands": [
